        "id": 1786377
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T07:26:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The `CFLAGS_REMOVE_` approach was found here:\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common/+/refs/heads/android16-6.12/rust/Makefile#9",
      "parentUuid": "2fae7d5f_b1d8edbe",
      "revId": "12ca4863ade580ca5a5164a3cd491f531efb1a35",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "46770823_9dde80cd",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-11T20:20:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I was only familiar with the reverse logic, e.g.:\n```\nCFLAGS_binder/page_range_helper.o \u003d -Wno-missing-prototypes -Wno-missing-declarations\n```\nThis is the first time I see `CFLAG_REMOVE_.*` approach. Seems ok although it seems to me the prototypes could just be defined within `page_range_helper.c` and we wouldn\u0027t need this.",
      "parentUuid": "6bf9de85_a2d369a6",
      "revId": "12ca4863ade580ca5a5164a3cd491f531efb1a35",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "142d0d82_ee8de0f3",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1786377
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-12T03:35:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In this case both `CFLAGS_*` and `CFLAG_REMOVE_*` are ok, I just followed the one already in `rust/Makefile`.\nI think defining prototypes within `page_range_helper.c` just loses the point of `-Wmissing-prototypes`.",
      "parentUuid": "46770823_9dde80cd",
      "revId": "12ca4863ade580ca5a5164a3cd491f531efb1a35",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "1c3ade99_0bfe4285",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1869395
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-12T18:52:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right, either CFLAGS approach is fine.\n\n\u003e I think defining prototypes within page_range_helper.c just loses the point of -Wmissing-prototypes.\n\nThe idea behind -Wmissing-prototypes is just to be explicit about local vs global and avoid forgetting to add `static`. Not that every prototype should be in a header file.\n\nIf you really want to use a header, then that is fine but please also _use_ the header where it\u0027s needed (otherwise it\u0027s kinda silly). I believe Alice gave some pointers if you want to go down this path.\n\nUsing `-Wno-missing-prototypes` would only mask future warns in this file.",
      "parentUuid": "142d0d82_ee8de0f3",
      "revId": "12ca4863ade580ca5a5164a3cd491f531efb1a35",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d23cd949_dc16ce9a",
        "filename": "/PATCHSET_LEVEL",
        "patchSetId": 1
      },
      "lineNbr": 0,
      "author": {
        "id": 1786377
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-09-15T02:39:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Using -Wno-missing-prototypes would only mask future warns in this file.  \n\nI believe it is desired because `page_range_helper.c` is `C helper for page_range.rs to work around a CFI violation.`",
      "parentUuid": "1c3ade99_0bfe4285",
      "revId": "12ca4863ade580ca5a5164a3cd491f531efb1a35",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e2718214_f73a52b9",
        "filename": "drivers/android/binder/page_range_helper.h",
